# Feature Engineering for Machine Learning

## Project Overview
This project demonstrates complete Feature Engineering techniques used in real-world Machine Learning pipelines.

## Techniques Implemented
- Handling Missing Values
- Encoding Categorical Variables
- Feature Scaling
- Feature Transformation
- Outlier Detection
- Feature Selection

## Tools & Libraries
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Project Workflow
1. Data Cleaning
2. Feature Engineering
3. Feature Transformation
4. Model Ready Dataset

